   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Followers Overview\n\nFollow notifications flip through in 3D, one name at a time, then the total follower count blurs in with a spring pop, the account handle and a confetti burst.\n\nCategory: social. Length: 12 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A milestone or social-proof scene needs cycling follow notifications that build to a total reveal.\n- You want a confetti-backed audience count as the payoff of a growth story.\n- Several recent followers should be shown, not a single profile.\n\nAvoid when:\n- You are highlighting one profile and a follow click: use profile-follow-card.\n- The scene needs a count-up with a list fly-through: use milestone-counter-list.\n- You only need a bare count-up with no feed or confetti: use rolling-number.\n\nVariables:\n- notifications (string): Notifications, default \"Maya Lindqvist|7h|v; Jonas Reyes|7h|v; marcus|8h; Lena Okoro|9h|v; dev_jay|10h; Priya Nair|11h|v; Tomas Brandt|13h|v; hana.k|15h; Will Archer|18h|v; Yuki Mori|21h|v; benoit|23h; Amara Diallo|1d|v; Leo Martins|1d|v; sol|2d\"\n- event_text (string): Event text, default \"followed you\"\n- total (number, 0-999999999): Total, default 1709\n- label (string): Count label, default \"Followers\"\n- handle (string): Handle, default \"studio\"\n- orientation (enum): Orientation, default \"auto\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#6366f1\"\n- theme (enum): Theme, default \"light\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n- speed (number, 0.25-4): Speed, default 1\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
